{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:numbers/24/5"}}
{"text":"מַה־טֹּבוּ אֹהָלֶיךָ יַעֲקֹב מִשְׁכְּנֹתֶיךָ יִשְׂרָאֵל:"}
{"end":"t:seg"}
