{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/5/8"}}
{"text":"וַאֲנִי בְּרֹב חַסְדְּךָ אָבֹא בֵיתֶךָ אֶשְׁתַּחֲוֶה אֶל־הֵיכַל קָדְשְׁךָ בְּיִרְאָתֶךָ:"}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/26/8"}}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"יְיָ"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" אָהַבְתִּי מְעוֹן בֵּיתֶךָ וּמְקוֹם מִשְׁכַּן כְּבוֹדֶךָ:"}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/95/6","type":"adaptation"}}
{"text":"וַאֲנִי אֶשְׁתַּחֲוֶה וְאֶכְרָעָה אֶבְרְכָה לִפְנֵי־"}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"יְיָ"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" עֹשִׂי:"}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/69/14"}}
{"text":"וַאֲנִי תְפִלָּתִי־לְךָ "}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"יְיָ"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" עֵת רָצוֹן אֱלֹהִים בְּרָב־חַסְדֶּךָ עֲנֵנִי בֶּאֱמֶת יִשְׁעֶךָ:"}
{"end":"t:seg"}
